            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "11-1 The Board and the Association acknowledge that a teacher's primary responsibility is to teach, and that his/her ener-gies should be utilized to this end. Therefore, the Board agrees to make every effort to acquire sufficient educational assistants and part-time clerical assistants for the purpose of relieving teachers of non-teaching duties.",
